	"descriptionMarkdown": "# Starter Kovarex Setup\nConsumes about 60 dark rock per minute, creates about 20 shiny rocks per minute.\n\nOptimized for fast ramp-up:\n- Machines only take enough  for once cycle\n- Machines are fed in linear order to ensure each of them comes online as fast as possible\n\nUsage:\n- Feed a split belt of shiny/dark rock in the middle (the side doesn't matter)\n- Output on the outer circular belt.\n\nWarning: the output is unsorted\n\nNegative: Uses more inserter than minimally required due to optimization.\n\n-- jmatya",
